  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1703.31 Saltwater Chronic Aquatic Life Criteria for Ammonia at a Salinity of 20 g/kg",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1703.31 Saltwater Chronic Aquatic Life Criteria for Ammonia at a Salinity of 20 g/kg. The values shown in Table 1703-9 shall be used to determine saltwater chronic aquatic life criteria for ammonia, in mg NH3 /L, for a salinity of 20 g/kg:\n\nTable 1703-9: Saltwater Chronic Aquatic Life Criteria for Ammonia in mg NH3/L; Salinity = 20 g/kg\n\npH | Temperature (°C)\n\n0 | 5 | 10 | 15 | 20 | 25 | 30 | 35\n\n7.0 | 44 | 30 | 21 | 14 | 9.7 | 6.6 | 4.7 | 3.1\n\n7.2 | 27 | 19 | 13 | 9.0 | 6.2 | 4.4 | 3.0 | 2.1\n\n7.4 | 18 | 12 | 8.1 | 5.6 | 4.1 | 2.7 | 1.9 | 1.3\n\n7.6 | 11 | 7.5 | 5.3 | 3.4 | 2.5 | 1.7 | 1.2 | 0.84\n\n7.8 | 6.9 | 4.7 | 3.4 | 2.3 | 1.6 | 1.1 | 0.78 | 0.53\n\n8.0 | 4.4 | 3.0 | 2.1 | 1.5 | 1.0 | 0.72 | 0.50 | 0.34\n\n8.2 | 2.8 | 1.9 | 1.3 | 0.94 | 0.66 | 0.47 | 0.31 | 0.24\n\n8.4 | 1.8 | 1.2 | 0.84 | 0.59 | 0.44 | 0.30 | 0.22 | 0.16\n\n8.6 | 1.1 | 0.78 | 0.56 | 0.41 | 0.28 | 0.20 | 0.15 | 0.12\n\n8.8 | 0.72 | 0.50 | 0.37 | 0.26 | 0.19 | 0.14 | 0.11 | 0.08\n\n9.0 | 0.47 | 0.34 | 0.24 | 0.18 | 0.13 | 0.10 | 0.08 | 0.07\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1700) #12042, eff 12-1-16; ss by #14203, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1700.html"
}
